The business aims to improve free-to-paid subscription conversion by supporting meaningful engagement and retention.

The project will evaluate whether the proposed MVP contributes to improved conversion while remaining within approved scope, budget and delivery constraints.

## 6.3 Measurement and Decision-Making

The business should be able to evaluate outcomes using validated conversion, engagement and retention metrics compared against established baselines.

Experiment findings should inform whether the MVP should be iterated, expanded or discontinued. Positive results from a limited pilot should not automatically authorize a full rollout.

Expected effects on revenue, CAC, CLTV and profitability remain subject to financial validation.

